sation with yourself.**\n\nPathfinder is an immersive tool for self-discovery and creative thinking. Using metaphorical cards\u2014rich, open-ended images\u2014it helps you bypass logical blocks and access your intuition. \n\n**How It Works:**\n1. **Choose a Topic:** Focus on a question, obstacle, or goal.\n2. **Draw Cards:** Select images that resonate with your situation and desired future.\n3. **Reflect:** Use voice-to-text or typing to capture insights. Guided prompts help you dig deeper.\n\n**Key Features:**\n* **Immersive VR:** A quiet, distraction-free space for your inner world.\n* **Metaphorical Deck:** Diverse images designed to spark creative insight.\n* **Voice Journaling:** Seamless transcription powered by Wit.ai.\n* **Private by Design:** No account creation required. All journals and history are stored locally on your headset.\n\n**Data Privacy & AI Disclosure:**\n\nIn compliance with developer data policies, Pathfinder uses Wit.ai to provide voice-to-text functionality. Voice data is transmitted to Wit.ai solely for the purpose of real-time transcription to enable the journaling feature. We do not store voice recordings, and your data is not used to train AI models.\n\n**Use Pathfinder to:**\n* Gain clarity on tough decisions.\n* Reconnect with your intuition.\n* Brainstorm creative ideas in a calm environment.", "short_description": "Unlock clarity with Pathfinder, an immersive VR tool for self-reflection. Use metaphorical cards to explore thoughts and define goals. Features AI-guided prompts and voice-to-text journaling powered by Wit.ai. To provide this service, voice data is processed by Wit.ai for real-time transcription only. We do not store voice recordings or use your data to train AI models. No account required\u2014all insights are stored locally on your headset for total privacy.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vR2jvcL4YAsnp7Za52r3Uv_xP-enX1CTFXBxewZnI4wyqQO56pziHYMQGUy6BmXBXG0tTYQ7XYoqdAh/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTguQqP8uCxKiY1nMxBWLbtmF0rwZ9jHGA_2y2NnsKbz_Nlp163o9_E4UjbWCA4Ka6WZgvP_d90A7Dx/pub", "publisher_name": "HumanSide", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.thepathfinderquest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25278630491831354"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1435219397934190"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1435219397934190"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1767867480, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1435219397934190"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25304898369204566", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "1589563492028991", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24710873175273758", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25304898369204566"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1589563492028991"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1766332846, "id": "253048